<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila now heads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting against Congolese government forces. The United States has imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama for supplying the rebels and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has exceeded 5,000 deaths, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/us-to-drop-south-africa-rwanda-from-duty-free-trade-initiative/a-79834508?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j346xg0mkvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE12QWlHTTk4T010X1NOeVFiNmJLR011RDJ4ZTY2UTVMVENCemd5M2FIRWxHUmRnN2Z1M3BVTWVyQThUczQwSmxEMHhzZnpLNURSMXpvOFF4S09YTTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE1pYzAtY1pkSXNvU3pIcVNXUjdJOVNDd2lONXU4cDVCNTIwNnF2NFQzNmZhUkdPSEFOSmZwZUJ6RnJ0WC1PWUVkQ0pzQ3lGRlBFZHpMakkyYXFQZHprMjVyVWJmcDFXYS1vWFk5bjJuT0w?oc=5&quot;&gt;ChimpReports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNTGNUaW5SUlo1c21ESS1iUWtHd19MSElhc0E3RWh5UXNEUHc3cUhVT2NXQlFaSnFLWVQwUGxaUXhoVmk1c3JWYVlfMC1hbFBCTlE4Z0V4ZkJMN0tZSUF2WVBuQ0JMVFZUYy1iR0ZmSnZmb0ZVcTJXZ3Nra2hmV3BPMmVacXlUVFFCVzNOQVd0X0pPTmhj?oc=5&quot;&gt;EWN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95c